<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: HSBC to arrange Czech Agrobanka share sale.</title>
<headline>HSBC to arrange Czech Agrobanka share sale.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank's (CNB) administrator at Agrobanka a.s., said the London office of investment bank HSBC had been selected to find a strategic equitiy investor in Agrobanka.</p>
</text>
